   "chunk_index": 106,
   "cite": "POL-PUR-001 v4.1, p.2, § 6. Supplier qualification",
   "text": "[Purchase Policy · POL-PUR-001 · v4.1 · effective 2026-04-01]\n[Purchase Policy › 6. Supplier qualification]\n6. Supplier qualification\n6.1 Orders may be placed only with suppliers that are active in the supplier master.\n6.2 Lithium-cell parts (battery packs, hub motors, chargers and any other item marked lithium-cell in\nthe item master) may be bought only from a supplier holding a valid UN 38.3 certificate on file in\nLedgerline. The certificate must be uploaded and checked before the first order is placed. An expired\ncertificate counts as no certificate.\n6.3 A new supplier is onboarded under the Supplier Policy (POL-SUP-003) before any order is placed\nwith them.\n6.4 Prefer the supplier with a current rate contract. A cheaper quotation from a new supplier does not\nby itself justify a change of supplier for a lithium-cell part.",
   "text_code": "[Purchase Policy · POL-PUR-001 · v4.1 · effective 2026-04-01]\n[Purchase Policy › 6. Supplier qualification]\n6. Supplier qualification\n6.1 Orders may be placed only with suppliers that are active in the supplier master.\n6.2 Lithium-cell parts (battery packs, hub motors, chargers and any other item marked lithium-cell in\nthe item master) may be bought only from a supplier holding a valid UN 38.3 certificate on file in\nLedgerline. The certificate must be uploaded and checked before the first order is placed. An expired\ncertificate counts as no certificate.\n6.3 A new supplier is onboarded under the Supplier Policy (POL-SUP-003) before any order is placed\nwith them.\n6.4 Prefer the supplier with a current rate contract. A cheaper quotation from a new supplier does not\nby itself justify a change of supplier for a lithium-cell part.",
